# CODEOWNERS — high-risk paths require review from a human (@RobertVejvoda),
# enforcing "Reviewer != Implementer" and keeping bot auto-merge out of
# security / infra / architecture-sensitive changes. Pairs with the
# "Require review from Code Owners" branch ruleset. Paths NOT listed here are
# eligible for low-risk auto-merge once the AUTO_MERGE_ENABLED variable is true.
#
# NOTE: keep this list in sync with the HIGH_RISK pattern in
# .github/workflows/agent-auto-merge.yml.

# CI, automation, and the guardrails themselves (self-modification protection)
/.github/                         @RobertVejvoda
/tools/security-gate.sh           @RobertVejvoda
/tools/llm-review.mjs             @RobertVejvoda
/tools/review-permission.sh       @RobertVejvoda

# Auth / security / secrets
**/auth/                          @RobertVejvoda
**/security/                      @RobertVejvoda

# Infrastructure / deployment
/code/infrastructure/             @RobertVejvoda
/tools/deploy-*.sh                @RobertVejvoda
**/Dockerfile                     @RobertVejvoda
**/docker-compose*.yml            @RobertVejvoda

# Database migrations
**/Migrations/                    @RobertVejvoda

# Dependencies / supply chain
**/package.json                   @RobertVejvoda
**/package-lock.json              @RobertVejvoda
**/*.csproj                       @RobertVejvoda
**/Directory.Packages.props       @RobertVejvoda
**/Directory.Build.props          @RobertVejvoda

